<title>SWEDEN: J/V completes Orrefors takeover.</title>
<headline>J/V completes Orrefors takeover.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>OKB Holding, a joint venture between Denmark's Royal Copenhagen A/S,  Scandinavian Equity Partners and investment company  Proventus AB, said on Friday it completed the takeover of Swedish glassmaker Orrefors Kosta Boda.  </p>
<p>OKB said in a statement it had extended its offer to shareholders until December 20 to complete the purchase.</p>
<p>OKB said it now owned 97 percent of votes and shares in Orrefors.</p>
<p>In a separate statement, Orrefors Kosta Boda said its last trading day on the Stockholm bourse would be December 30.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
